{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "APPLICATION APPROVED" %}
{% set headline = "Your Operator Application Has Been Approved" %}
{% block body %}
Your operator application has been approved. Welcome to the federation.

Next steps:
  1. Register at {{ registry_ui_url }} (if you haven't already)
  2. Log in and go to the Operator Portal
  3. Enter your activation code:

       {{ activation_code }}

This code expires in 7 days.
{% if release_channel_public_pull %}
Images: your bundle pulls {{ images_prefix }}/{registry,teg-layer,cert-writer}:{{ images_tag }} from the public
image channel (no login needed), or build them from the kit. Updates: your registry's admin is notified of stable
releases and hotfixes on the signed release channel and schedules the rollout; `tp update` applies it.
{% endif %}

Questions? Contact commander@theprotocol.cloud
{% endblock %}
